          "trajectory_retract": 9,
          "trajectory_home": 10,
          "comment": "低4位规则：实时操控 0..3（keyboard=0, teleop=1, vision=2, shared=3）；预定轨迹 8..10（extend=8, retract=9, home=10）；未选择为 0；保留 realtime 4..7, trajectory 11..15"
